type: software
title: "Three-Body Orbit Atlas (threebody-closing-the-open)"
abstract: >-
  Research code and numerical records behind the Letter manuscript
  "Continuation Geometry Resolves Apparent Branch Splitting in Unequal-Mass
  Three-Body Orbits": continuation and Floquet stability of unequal-mass planar
  three-body periodic orbits from the Li, Li and Liao dataset. Work in progress.
